{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T16:52:49+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T16:52:49+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"NIBE Industrier AB (publ)","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Building Products & Equipment","country":"Sweden","city":"Markaryd","website":"https://www.nibe.com","employees":20500,"summary":"NIBE Industrier AB (publ), together with its subsidiaries, develops, manufactures, markets, and sells energy-efficient solutions for indoor climate comfort, and components and solutions for intelligent heating and control. It operates through NIBE Climate Solutions, NIBE Element, and NIBE Stoves business areas. The NIBE Climate Solutions business area offers indoor climate comfort products, such as heat pumps, water heaters, refrigeration systems, accumulator tanks, ventilation systems, climate control systems, and district heating products for homes, apartment blocks, and commercial properties. The NIBE Element business area provides various components and solutions for heating and control, which include tubular, aluminum, foil, thick film, PTC, high-power, and ceramic elements, as well as opena spirals and tapes, heating cables and jackets, vacuum brazing, heat pump technology, resistors, heat exchangers, temperature sensors, heating cables, flexible hoses, and control equipment to domestic and household appliances; professional kitchens and the refrigeration industry; energy; transport; and advanced technology, as well as aviation sectors. The NIBE Stoves business area offers free-standing, wood-burning, gas, and electric stoves; heat-retaining products; and chimney systems, as well as inserts, fireplace cassettes, outdoor stoves, and accessories. It operates in Nordic countries, rest of Europe, North America, and internationally. The company was founded in 1949 and is headquartered in Markaryd, Sweden.","exchange":"Stockholm","currency":"SEK","financial_currency":"SEK","summary_fr":"NIBE Industrier AB (publ), en collaboration avec ses filiales, développe, fabrique, commercialise et vend des solutions écoénergétiques pour le confort climatique intérieur, ainsi que des composants et des solutions pour le chauffage et le contrôle intelligents. Elle opère par l'intermédiaire des secteurs d'activité NIBE Climate Solutions, NIBE Element et NIBE Stoves. Le secteur d'activité NIBE Climate Solutions propose des produits de confort pour le climat intérieur, tels que des pompes à chaleur, des chauffe-eau, des systèmes de réfrigération, des réservoirs d'accumulateurs, des systèmes de ventilation, des systèmes de climatisation et des produits de chauffage urbain pour les maisons, les immeubles d'appartements et les propriétés commerciales."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":91851988992,"shares_outstanding":1782936128,"trailing_pe":34.77863,"forward_pe":26.95858,"price_to_book":2.841462,"ev_to_ebitda":19.412,"ev_to_revenue":2.643,"dividend_yield":0.0077,"payout_ratio":0.2675,"beta_yahoo":0.881},"targets":{"current_price":45.56,"mean":46.92308,"median":47.0,"high":57.0,"low":29.0,"n_analysts":13,"reco_mean":2.23077,"reco_key":"buy"},"calendar":{"earnings_dates":["2026-11-17"],"eps_avg":0.46079,"eps_low":0.42,"eps_high":0.49,"revenue_avg":11049871590,"ex_dividend":"2026-05-20","dividend_date":null},"holders":{"insiders_pct":0.18778999,"institutions_pct":0.42549,"institutions_float_pct":0.52387,"institutions_n":292,"institutions":[{"name":"Everett Harris & Co/CA/","pct":0.0001,"shares":110000,"value":5011600,"date":"2026-03-31","chg":0.0}],"funds":[{"name":"VANGUARD STAR FUNDS-Vanguard Total International Stock Index Fund","pct":0.0121,"shares":21546463,"value":981656883,"date":"2026-07-31","chg":0.0105},{"name":"VANGUARD TAX-MANAGED FUNDS-Vanguard Developed Markets Index Fund","pct":0.007900001,"shares":14169188,"value":645548224,"date":"2026-06-30","chg":0.0095},{"name":"iShares Trust-iShares Core MSCI EAFE ETF","pct":0.0062,"